{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014mP6y1EhoceaqWNPUmkqv5","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * GTS Design System - Global Styles\n     3→ * Guitar Tone Shootout design tokens and base styles\n     4→ */\n     5→\n     6→@tailwind base;\n     7→@tailwind components;\n     8→@tailwind utilities;\n     9→\n    10→@layer base {\n    11→  :root {\n    12→    /* Background colors */\n    13→    --color-bg-base: #0a0a0b;\n    14→    --color-bg-surface: #18181b;\n    15→    --color-bg-elevated: #27272a;\n    16→\n    17→    /* Text colors */\n    18→    --color-text-primary: #fafafa;\n    19→    --color-text-secondary: #d4d4d8;\n    20→    --color-text-muted: #a1a1aa;\n    21→\n    22→    /* Accent colors */\n    23→    --color-accent-primary: #3b82f6;\n    24→    --color-accent-secondary: #8b5cf6;\n    25→    --color-accent-success: #10b981;\n    26→    --color-accent-warning: #f59e0b;\n    27→    --color-accent-error: #ef4444;\n    28→    --color-accent-info: #06b6d4;\n    29→\n    30→    /* Block type colors - for signal chain visualization */\n    31→    --color-block-amp: #dc2626;\n    32→    --color-block-pedal: #ea580c;\n    33→    --color-block-loop: #f59e0b;\n    34→    --color-block-ir: #10b981;\n    35→    --color-block-pre: #06b6d4;\n    36→    --color-block-post: #8b5cf6;\n    37→\n    38→    /* Gear type colors - for gear library */\n    39→    --color-gear-amp: #dc2626;\n    40→    --color-gear-cab: #10b981;\n    41→    --color-gear-pedal: #ea580c;\n    42→    --color-gear-full-rig: #8b5cf6;\n    43→  }\n    44→\n    45→  /* Base styles */\n    46→  body {\n    47→    background-color: var(--color-bg-base);\n    48→    color: var(--color-text-primary);\n    49→  }\n    50→}\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5fb191fb-fc5f-4be7-9bca-7e098211f215","uuid":"56341234-bca8-472b-88b5-c98872f5791f","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"frontend/astro/src/styles/global.css","content":"/**\n * GTS Design System - Global Styles\n * Guitar Tone Shootout design tokens and base styles\n */\n\n@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    /* Background colors */\n    --color-bg-base: #0a0a0b;\n    --color-bg-surface: #18181b;\n    --color-bg-elevated: #27272a;\n\n    /* Text colors */\n    --color-text-primary: #fafafa;\n    --color-text-secondary: #d4d4d8;\n    --color-text-muted: #a1a1aa;\n\n    /* Accent colors */\n    --color-accent-primary: #3b82f6;\n    --color-accent-secondary: #8b5cf6;\n    --color-accent-success: #10b981;\n    --color-accent-warning: #f59e0b;\n    --color-accent-error: #ef4444;\n    --color-accent-info: #06b6d4;\n\n    /* Block type colors - for signal chain visualization */\n    --color-block-amp: #dc2626;\n    --color-block-pedal: #ea580c;\n    --color-block-loop: #f59e0b;\n    --color-block-ir: #10b981;\n    --color-block-pre: #06b6d4;\n    --color-block-post: #8b5cf6;\n\n    /* Gear type colors - for gear library */\n    --color-gear-amp: #dc2626;\n    --color-gear-cab: #10b981;\n    --color-gear-pedal: #ea580c;\n    --color-gear-full-rig: #8b5cf6;\n  }\n\n  /* Base styles */\n  body {\n    background-color: var(--color-bg-base);\n    color: var(--color-text-primary);\n  }\n}","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":51}}}
